  "borough": "London Borough of Barking and Dagenham",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "In the absence of further information, the proposal fails to demonstrate that the noise, chemical overspill and general disturbance resultant of the proposed jet wash bays would not cause undue harm to the amenity of nearby residential occupiers. The proposal is therefore at odds with the following policies which seek to ensure that development proposals protect residential amenity:&nbsp;National Planning Policy Framework (December 2023)Policies D13 and D14 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policies DMD1 and DMSI3 of&nbsp;The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September 2024)",
    "In the absence of further information, the proposal fails to demonstrate that it would provide suitable drainage for the proposed jet washing facility. The proposal is therefore likely to have an unacceptable impact on the quantity and quality of the borough&#39;s water supply, at odds with the following policies:National Planning Policy Framework (December 2023)Policy SI 13 of the London Plan (March 2021)Policy DMSI 7 of&nbsp;The Barking and Dagenham Local Plan (September 2024)"
  ],
